  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-593944386690220564 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/bg1v1z-zg/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=593944386606203412&sectionId=593944386690220564)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_jnW8l5X5_text","label":"gg_jnW8l5X5_text","default":"<p><strong>\"Your TSH is Perfect\" – The 4 Words That Nearly Destroyed My Life While I Gained 60 Pounds Eating 900 Calories</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPp4_CtBiX_text","label":"ggPp4_CtBiX_text","default":"By <strong>Sarah Chen</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglr5gNNPty_text","label":"gglr5gNNPty_text","default":"<p>Last Updated Mar 3.2025</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggj2kmbnq_-_text","label":"ggj2kmbnq_-_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Listen, if you're reading this, you probably just came from my story about gaining 60 pounds while eating 900 calories.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">About how 13 doctors dismissed me with \"Your TSH is perfect.\"</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">About finding Dr. Margaret Anne who finally explained Reverse T3 – the hormone that was jamming my metabolism like broken keys in locks.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">But there's more to this story. Things I couldn't fit in that post.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Like how this isn't just about weight.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">It's about a medical system that systematically ignores women with hypothyroidism while we literally disappear in front of them.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">And more importantly – it's about the exact science behind why you're gaining weight on nothing, and the precise solution that helped me and 30,000 other women finally start losing again.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8Vj81XRvT_text","label":"gg8Vj81XRvT_text","default":"<strong>I Wasn't Always The Woman Gaining Weight on 900 Calories</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRW_iN68BA_text","label":"ggRW_iN68BA_text","default":"<p>Two years ago, I was a different person.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not just physically – though going from size 8 to 18 was devastating enough.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I mean I was ALIVE. Coffee walks with friends. Weekend hikes. Dancing at my daughter's wedding without needing to sit every 10 minutes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then hypothyroidism hit like a freight train.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>First came the exhaustion. Not tired – EXHAUSTION. Like someone replaced my blood with concrete.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then the weight started piling on. But here's what made it truly insane:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The less I ate, the faster I gained.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Started at 1,500 calories – gained 15 pounds in 3 months.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Dropped to 1,200 calories – gained another 20 pounds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Went down to 900 calories – gained 25 MORE pounds</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>My endocrinologist's response? \"Your TSH is 2.5. That's perfect. Maybe try eating less processed food.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I was living on grilled chicken and steamed broccoli. What processed food?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwBnSIoNIg_text","label":"ggwBnSIoNIg_text","default":"<strong>The Hidden Hormone 97% of Doctors Refuse to Test</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXcjld3Nx__text","label":"ggXcjld3Nx__text","default":"<p>After 13 doctors and 2 years of gaslighting, I finally found Dr. <span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Margaret Anne</span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She didn't just listen – she EXPLAINED.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"Your doctors are only testing TSH and T4,\" she said. \"But they're missing the whole story.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She drew me a diagram I'll never forget:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Here's what SHOULD happen:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Your thyroid makes T4 (inactive hormone)</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Your body converts T4 to T3 (active hormone)</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>T3 unlocks your metabolism like keys in locks</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>You burn calories and have energy</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Here's what's ACTUALLY happening with hypothyroidism:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Your thyroid makes T4 (or you take it as levothyroxine)</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>But stress, inflammation, and nutrient deficiencies cause your body to convert T4 to REVERSE T3 instead</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Reverse T3 looks like T3 but doesn't work</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>These broken keys jam the locks</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Real T3 can't get in</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Your metabolism shuts down</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>\"And here's the part that will make you angry,\" Dr. </strong><span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong>Margaret Anne</strong></span><strong> continued.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"When you restrict calories severely – like your 900 calories – your body sees it as starvation stress. What does stress trigger? MORE Reverse T3 production.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I wanted to scream.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every time I ate less to lose weight, I was literally making my body create MORE of the hormone that prevented weight loss.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqaZGTXA_2_text","label":"ggqaZGTXA_2_text","default":"<strong>The 2:1 Protocol That Clears The \"Broken Keys\" From Your System</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5dSkQ3uSz_text","label":"gg5dSkQ3uSz_text","default":"<p>\"Can you just prescribe something to fix this?\" I begged Dr. <span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Margaret Anne</span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She sighed. \"I wish I could. But there's no FDA-approved medication for Reverse T3. The medical establishment doesn't even acknowledge it as a problem.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then she leaned in and whispered something that changed everything:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"But there IS a solution. It's not a drug – it's targeted nutrition that fixes the conversion problem at its source.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She wrote down a specific combination:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>The 2:1 Protocol:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>Selenium (200mcg):</strong> Forces your body to stop making Reverse T3 and start making real T3</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>Iodine (100mcg):</strong> But ONLY in a 2:1 ratio with selenium – too much makes it worse</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>Ashwagandha:</strong> Drops cortisol by 30% (cortisol triggers Reverse T3)</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>L-Tyrosine:</strong> Raw material for thyroid hormones</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>Zinc:</strong> Helps cells actually USE the T3</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>Vitamin D3:</strong> Reduces the inflammation that triggers conversion problems</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"This combination addresses the ROOT CAUSE,\" she explained. \"Not just masks symptoms like levothyroxine.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyAmcwjUKZ_text","label":"ggyAmcwjUKZ_text","default":"<strong>Then I Found What 30,000 Women Were Quietly Using to Fix This</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtHf36GAlh_text","label":"ggtHf36GAlh_text","default":"<p>I went home and started searching.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most supplements had maybe 1 or 2 of these ingredients. Nothing had the right ratios. The ones that came close were $200+ per month.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then I found myself deep in r/Hypothyroidism at 2 AM (you know how it goes).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Buried in a thread about \"What Actually Worked For You?\" I saw comment after comment about something called Peak Form:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9kOq3vWn0_text","label":"gg9kOq3vWn0_text","default":"<p>I checked the ingredients – EVERYTHING Dr. Margaret Anne mentioned. Exact ratios. Liquid form for better absorption (important when your digestion is compromised from hypothyroidism).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>$32 a month. I'd spent that on one week of Red Bulls just to stay conscious.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXk3JYZs3L_text","label":"ggXk3JYZs3L_text","default":"<p>SALE ENDS SOON</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_dayLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_dayLabel","default":"Days"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_hourLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_hourLabel","default":"hrs"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_minuteLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_minuteLabel","default":"min"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_secondLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_secondLabel","default":"sec"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_weekLabel","label":"ggJ9wtAiWFP_weekLabel","default":"Weeks"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFSc96f3xi_text","label":"ggFSc96f3xi_text","default":"<p>We only produce 5,000 bottles per month. With 4,726+ success stories spreading on social media, we sell out every 3 weeks. Next batch won't arrive for another 6-8 weeks.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2t5f4dfBF_label","label":"gg2t5f4dfBF_label","default":"<p>CHECK AVAILIBILITY NOW 👉</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVEAnsiX9o_text","label":"ggVEAnsiX9o_text","default":"<p>Sell-out Risk: <span style=\"color:#E30D0D;\"><strong>High</strong></span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggStiKq6yMT_text","label":"ggStiKq6yMT_text","default":"<p>|</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyzMTEHkRf_text","label":"ggyzMTEHkRf_text","default":"<p><strong>FREE Gifts</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIugrpED0F_text","label":"ggIugrpED0F_text","default":"<p>Try it today with a 30-Day Money Back Guarantee!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIgrMRAu_-_text","label":"ggIgrMRAu_-_text","default":"<strong>My 12-Week Transformation (Eating 1,900 Calories, Not 900)</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrROIC3n1g_text","label":"ggrROIC3n1g_text","default":"<p>When my bottle arrived, I was skeptical.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After 2 years of failed supplements, failed diets, failed everything – how could a dropper of liquid minerals fix what 13 doctors couldn't?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But here's what happened:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Day 4:</strong><i> Scale dropped 0.3 lbs. First decrease in 2 YEARS.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 1:</strong> <i>Down 1.2 lbs eating 1,400 calories (not 900!)</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 2:</strong><i> Energy at 3 PM without Red Bull. Stayed awake through entire work meeting.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 4:</strong><i> Down 4.3 lbs. Jeans aren't cutting into me.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 8:</strong><i> Down 11.4 lbs. Coworker asked \"What changed?\"</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Week 12:</strong><i> Down 17.6 lbs eating 1,900 calories daily.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But the best part wasn't even the weight loss.</p><p>It was going back to Dr. <span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Margaret Anne</span> at week 13. She ran my labs:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>TSH: 1.5 (optimal)</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Reverse T3: Cleared</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Free T3: Finally in range</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She looked at the Peak Form bottle and smiled. \"This is exactly what I hoped you'd find.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxR467kh8y_label","label":"ggxR467kh8y_label","default":"<p>CHECK AVAILABILITY NOW</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoNtdcxfZZ_text","label":"ggoNtdcxfZZ_text","default":"<strong>You Deserve to Stop Being Gaslit and Start Being Heard</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsYcSzFTjT_text","label":"ggsYcSzFTjT_text","default":"<p>Listen, I know you're skeptical. You should be.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After being dismissed by doctors, trying every diet, buying every Instagram supplement that promised miracles – why should this be different?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here's the truth: <strong>It's different because it addresses the actual problem.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not your willpower. Not your calorie counting. Not your \"perfect\" TSH.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Reverse T3 that's been jamming your metabolism this whole time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Peak Form isn't another band-aid. It's the targeted nutrition your body needs to:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Stop producing Reverse T3</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Start converting T4 to actual T3</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Clear the metabolic blockage</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Finally lose weight eating normal amounts</p>"}],
